mento.<br \/>\r\nJaboatao Dos Guararapes, 22 de janeiro de 2026.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif\">        <\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif\"><strong>BRUNO HENRIQUE DE OLIVEIRA VANDERLEI<\/strong><br \/>\r\n<strong>OAB\/MS 23679-A<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t","tipo_id":"47","name_text":"","edit_text":"1","url_dir":"","nomecli":"","petnome":"","codsav":"20260123003250","nomepet":"RCJ.32216005.CARLOS JOSE DOS SANTOS.20260123","hid_enviar":"3","TIPOPET":""}
